@startuml
title killAllSubmissions — POST /killall

|#LightBlue|Controller|
|#LightGreen|Service|

start

|Controller|

:HTTP POST /v1/submissions/killall;

|Service|

:DELETE FROM spark_submissions WHERE status IN (QUEUED, CLAIMED);

:Return CreateSubmissionResponse(message=KILLED N queued/claimed tasks, success=true);

stop

